    },
    {
      "id": "1281545338108514367",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T09:23:38.566+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "The proposal is shit, it’s bland and the only reason we know it’s not generated by ChatGPT is because it’s not coherent enough to come from a bot. By all logical and reasonable standards, it should fall *well* short of any sort of standards the Security Council might uphold.",
      "author": {
        "id": "362575320559386634",
        "name": "jowhatup",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "joWhatup",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/362575320559386634/f5bb91b8570ccd9af16a7c917d65fee7.png?size=512"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1281547280415068234",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T09:31:21.648+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2024-09-06T09:33:37.797+00:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Defenders can write something better. We know that, because they used to do so when they weren’t guaranteed a rubber stamp. The reason they’re not is because they’re blatantly abusing the Security Council to farm badges with impunity, and everyone can see it. Like the TBH repeal presently at vote, this is not a genuine effort but a hijacking of the Security Council’s functions for Defenders’ own ends. And they have gotten away with it so often that they no longer even try to disguise it. \n\nThey do not care about Kelios, they do not care about the World Assembly, and we know they do not care about *us*, the League has repeatedly demonstrated that. Kelios is none of the things described in the proposal, it is a wasteland I myself have led frequent small-scale raids against. Accuse me of having an agenda if you want, I don’t deny it - but I am wholly and utterly baffled as to why we should continue to aid the people who hate us make a mockery of the same Security Council they have weaponised against our own nominees time and again.",
      "author": {
        "id": "362575320559386634",
        "name": "jowhatup",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "joWhatup",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/362575320559386634/f5bb91b8570ccd9af16a7c917d65fee7.png?size=512"
      },
