    {
      "id": "1281657156890001489",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T16:47:58.241+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Even if the Libcord elites do not care about sovereignty and protection from griefing, The East Pacific does.",
      "author": {
        "id": "738186404399415336",
        "name": "theconstantofchange",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Mango",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/738186404399415336/bdd56904d110e67bff6d8988b5d7d327.png?size=512"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1281657368974856335",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T16:48:48.806+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Of course it would be nice if they put effort into it, but if they don't, we have a choice to sacrifice our values and an entire region just to give them a wake up call. That is, if we even had the votes to shoot it down.",
      "author": {
        "id": "738186404399415336",
        "name": "theconstantofchange",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Mango",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/738186404399415336/bdd56904d110e67bff6d8988b5d7d327.png?size=512"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1281657484209164431",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T16:49:16.28+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Meanwhile, our relationship with defenders, including our own allies, is incredibly strained. Voting against liberations and injunctions isn't going to help that, not even if we cite poor quality as the reason for doing so.",
      "author": {
        "id": "738186404399415336",
        "name": "theconstantofchange",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "Mango",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/738186404399415336/bdd56904d110e67bff6d8988b5d7d327.png?size=512"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1281664555533209764",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T17:17:22.215+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Of course, we don’t have the votes to single-handedly turn things around so we should just bow down to the majority and accept the shit they throw our way.",
      "author": {
        "id": "362575320559386634",
        "name": "jowhatup",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "joWhatup",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/362575320559386634/f5bb91b8570ccd9af16a7c917d65fee7.png?size=512"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "reference": {
        "type": "Default",
        "messageId": "1281657368974856335",
        "channelId": "1281450469490823228",
        "guildId": "633351482128728064"
      },
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1281664820826869851",
      "type": "Reply",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T17:18:25.466+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Yeah, because they keep treating us like shit. That’s not a reason for us to suddenly just carry out their will, that’s a reason for us to question why exactly they’re supposed to be our allies.",
      "author": {
        "id": "362575320559386634",
        "name": "jowhatup",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "joWhatup",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/362575320559386634/f5bb91b8570ccd9af16a7c917d65fee7.png?size=512"
      },
      "attachments": [],
      "embeds": [],
      "stickers": [],
      "reactions": [],
      "mentions": [],
      "reference": {
        "type": "Default",
        "messageId": "1281657484209164431",
        "channelId": "1281450469490823228",
        "guildId": "633351482128728064"
      },
      "inlineEmojis": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1281674621061431398",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-09-06T17:57:22.024+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "It's a reason for us to not throw our ideals by the wayside just to piss them off.",
